{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1320407001:0":{"text":"呼金，你最近有空吗？我们想拜托你制造一样物品~","source_cn":"呼金，你最近有空吗？我们想拜托你制造一样物品~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B29AB266AA9D4AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320407002:0":{"text":"嚯，还有这么巧的事！我正打算问问你们有什么好想法呢！","source_cn":"嚯，还有这么巧的事！我正打算问问你们有什么好想法呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8AD37BA4A5DC206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320407003:1":{"text":"自打被老约恩抓去雕刻冰雕后，总感觉我的脑子好像被冻僵了，怎么也想不出接下来该做点什么新鲜的小玩意，愁坏我了。","source_cn":"自打被老约恩抓去雕刻冰雕后，总感觉我的脑子好像被冻僵了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x154F53EA225DDB5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320407004:0":{"text":"由我来说吧，这样更清楚。","source_cn":"由我来说吧，这样更清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EA4F298F5F19FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320407005:0":{"text":"我们白熊温泉旅店想开辟一些野温泉，但没办法很快确定它们的位置，所以想请你制造一种能探测温泉的机器。","source_cn":"我们白熊温泉旅店想开辟一些野温泉，但没办法很快确定它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E249480DA1509A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu